 * Sandboxed preloads can only require Electron built-ins, so the preload
 * cannot import the shared contract's table at runtime — the shared module
 * is ESM and the preload is CommonJS. The duplication is therefore checked
 * rather than assumed: `tests/electron/preload-channels.test.ts` asserts
 * that this table and the shared one agree, so the two cannot drift apart
